      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW SAUNDRA (1) hit the ground running with a slick early sectional but ran over late and missed the frame when a 4 length fourth (22.93) over 400m at Geelong. Has ability and is a key runner. PAW JAXSON (3) took the sit on the lead from an outside box but levelled up and drew clear to score (21.96) at Warrnambool in a Grade 5 over 390m. Expecting another bold showing. PAW VINE (4) has a strong winning strike-rate over this track and trip with two wins and a placing from six tries. In the money last time at Sale (24.52) in a Grade 5, finishing a 2.25 lengths third. Among the main chances. NANGAR MACIE (2) missed the placings here last start but is well-placed to atone.",
